WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 06d0de241694c5f7ca95fb260eaf98a7

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.620
Sawa, karibu tena. Hebu tuendelee pale

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.960
tulipoishia kwenye video iliyopita. Basi tulikuwa

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.870
na msimbo huu unaochora duara mahali

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.940
tofauti kila unapoendeshwa.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.220
Kama tunataka kuchora maduara 10

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.240
mahali tofauti, tunaweza kuunganisha hili na

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.710
kitanzi. Natumaini hili linaonekana rahisi kwako

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:24.180
sasa. Lakini kama unafuatilia

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.500
kwa makini, huenda umeona kitu

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.760
cha ajabu hapa. Kama huoni tatizo

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.640
mara moja, simamisha video kwa

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.100
sekunde chache na ujaribu kubaini

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:40.100
kinachoonekana cha ajabu hapa. Sawa, natumaini umekipata.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.900
Kama bado, simamisha video. Kama

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.540
hukioni, usijali. Ni jambo

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.080
gumu kugundua, kwa hivyo si ajabu kama hukukiona.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.320
Mwanzoni, nilisema kuna sheria

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:54.340
kwamba masanduku kwenye rafu za Jiki lazima yawe na

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:59.880
majina ya kipekee, na kwamba keyword let huunda

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.060
sanduku jipya kila unapoitumia.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.960
Lakini kwa sababu let iko ndani ya kitanzi,

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:09.780
Jiki ataunda sanduku jipya kila

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.460
kitanzi kinapoendeshwa. Kwa hivyo, msimbo huu

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.720
una hitilafu, au kuna kitu kingine cha ajabu kinatokea hapa?

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.840
Kumbe msimbo huu uko sawa.

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:24.540
Hii ni JavaScript halali kabisa, na inafanya kazi

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:27.400
kwa sababu ya dhana inayoitwa scope (wigo), au scoping.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.620
Scope ni kitu ambacho mwanzoni huenda

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:35.000
kitaonekana rahisi kabisa, lakini nakuhakikishia

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.370
kitakuletea matatizo kwa muda wote

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:41.030
wa kazi yako. Hata wasanidi programu wenye uzoefu mkubwa

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:44.830
hukutana na matatizo ya scope, na JavaScript ni mojawapo

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:48.060
ya lugha zilizo ngumu zaidi kwa hili.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.200
Nakuambia hivi ili utakapokutana

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:53.000
na matatizo ya scope,

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:55.520
usijihisi vibaya. Lakini pia,

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:57.730
zingatia sana sehemu hii

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:02.400
kwa sababu ni muhimu. Unapoona mabano yaliyopinda

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:06.460
kwenye msimbo, huunda kile kinachoitwa

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.759
scope mpya. Hiyo inamaanisha nini?

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:12.920
Fikiria Jiki akiunda seti ndogo mpya

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.420
ya rafu katika karakana yake kila anapoona

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:18.740
mabano yaliyopinda. Na masanduku yoyote

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.370
anayounda anapofanya kazi, akiendesha msimbo ndani ya

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.580
mabano hayo yaliyopinda, masanduku hayo mapya

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:29.340
huwekwa kwenye seti ndogo mpya ya rafu,

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:32.680
si kwenye rafu kuu. Na Jiki anapofika

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:37.140
kwenye mabano yaliyopinda ya kufunga yanayolingana,

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.660
hutupa masanduku yote yaliyo kwenye

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:43.660
seti hii ya pili ya rafu. Kwa hivyo kila

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.840
tunapokuwa na kitanzi kama hiki, tunaweza

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:49.320
kuunda masanduku yanayodumu tu kwa muda wa

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:53.380
marudio moja ya kitanzi. Masanduku ya left (kushoto)

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.829
na top (juu) unayoyaona hapa, yanadumu tu

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:59.440
hadi tunapofika kwenye mabano yaliyopinda ya kufunga,

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.320
kisha yanatupwa. Na Jiki

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:06.280
hufika kwenye mabano hayo ya kufunga kila

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.200
kitanzi kinapoendeshwa. Kwa hivyo ni mara 10

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:12.600
katika programu hii. Hivyo mara 10 ataunda sanduku

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:14.769
linaloitwa left, na atalitupa tena.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.500
Kwa hivyo unapounda variable,

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:20.260
lazima uamue unataka idumu

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:22.760
kwa muda gani. Kama unataka

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.780
idumu kwa muda mrefu, inabidi

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:28.180
iwe nje ya mabano yoyote yaliyopinda.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.960
Kama unataka idumu kwa marudio moja tu,

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.000
yaani mzunguko mmoja wa kitanzi, basi unaweza

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:36.250
kuiweka ndani ya mabano yaliyopinda.

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.700
Unaona jinsi hii inaweza

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:41.390
kuchanganya kidogo? Kwa hivyo sheria moja nzuri

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.960
ya kurahisisha hili unapoanza ni kuweka

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.920
variable zako zote karibu na mwanzo wa

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:48.590
msimbo wako nje ya mabano yaliyopinda,

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:51.420
na kisha kuzibadilisha tu ndani ya mabano.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.350
Kwa mfano, tunaweza kuandika msimbo ulio juu

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.700
ukiwa na sanduku moja tu la left na moja la top,

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:59.600
yaliyowekwa sifuri mwanzoni, kisha yakabadilishwa

00:03:59.609 --> 00:04:02.200
kila mara ndani ya kitanzi. Hiyo pia ni halali kabisa.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.480
Hakuna iliyo sahihi au isiyo sahihi.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.380
Kuna njia bora za kufanya mambo, lakini tutajifunza kuzihusu baadaye.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:11.660
Kwa sasa, jaribu, furahia, angalia ni ipi

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.900
inayokufaa zaidi, na jaribu

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.190
kutojisumbua sana na hili. Tuonane

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:16.700
kwenye video ijayo.
